+# Final review — cluster 2 (docs) — hg-k4l
+
+Invocation inv-17c351e9-bb55-40c3-8436-8b30e7f45319. Captured source: base 0dbe4772f4cd541e6b5ecaa1dd55b9a72f62c784, head efc21b65eb225578d3a623b29f23b3688849ea8b (both verified with `git rev-parse --verify <sha>^{commit}`). The caller checkout was at efc21b6 with a clean status when the review started. The source binding (`bind-review-source`) succeeded.
