+- B1, B2, B3, B4, B14 (daemon-error mapping, exit 5/6, no fallbacks): delivery is in the cli, daemon, bootstrap and ipc-rs clusters and the skill (misc). The beads are closed (hg-k4l.1/.2/.3/.12/.18). The production path leaves this cluster, so tracing it is the seam reviewer's job.
